            loading="lazy"
            width="843"
            height="843"
          />
          <figcaption>
            Watch movement, Charles Cabrier II, London, ca. 1740–60. The Metropolitan Museum of Art,
            public domain. Not ours — the trade we learned the balance cock from.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

